# Cline Rules

Before making any change, read and follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root — it is the single source of
truth for architecture, coding conventions, development workflow, resource disposal, verification pipeline,
and testing rules.

If `agents_project.md` also exists in the repository root, read and follow it too — it documents this
project's specific stack, architecture, and commands.

Do not introduce Cline-specific overrides unless explicitly required.
